    'Execution: extend the lifted leg straight back at hip height while the bottom hand reaches to a block or the floor for support, opening the chest and top arm toward the ceiling, hips stacked rather than rolled forward.',
    'Whole-body integration: this pose combines the standing-leg stability from Tree Pose with the hip-hinge alignment from Triangle Pose into one more demanding, integrated balance challenge — it\'s a genuine combination pose, similar in spirit to Pilates\' Teaser.',
